{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6639.736779,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und"},{"kind":"text","t":6964.939362,"text":"But after the loss of the captain's wicket, India scored only 36 runs and"},{"kind":"audio","t":7023.051842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7024.3746280000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":7025.759806000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7027.3638280000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":7027.566873000001,"samples":9928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":10118.855187,"text":"und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10322.71942,"text":"and lost seven wickets, which ended the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10376.114223999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10381.309358999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10383.896230999999,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":19518.666626000002,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":19944.565706,"text":"They usually have a special selection of food, drinks, and entertainment to keep the guests happy and ensure that they stay."},{"kind":"audio","t":20004.211396000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20005.584434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20007.161696000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20008.713847000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20010.328979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20012.011563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":20012.141366,"samples":4392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":28684.975208,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29192.769706000003,"text":"Del Potro had an early advantage in the second set, but once again a tie-break was required after 6-6 was reached."},{"kind":"audio","t":29252.423346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29253.804154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29255.415437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29257.020349000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29258.682522000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29260.340056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29260.727254,"samples":13392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37124.969023,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation"},{"kind":"text","t":37285.365261,"text":"The internet combines elements of mass communication"},{"kind":"audio","t":37336.358217,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37337.773635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37339.145872999994,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":41904.220644,"text":"als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":42044.995397,"text":"as well as interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42083.060203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42084.540913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42085.309878,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":51173.846682999996,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden."},{"kind":"text","t":51489.230209999994,"text":"The composition of these crystals corresponds to the composition found in the urine of affected pets."},{"kind":"audio","t":51546.098264,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51547.631075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51549.268388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51550.989581999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51552.551644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":51552.646475999994,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":55313.950613,"text":"wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektrokopters bedacht."},{"kind":"text","t":55487.694988999996,"text":"when they are examined using infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"audio","t":55537.672305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55539.281667999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":55540.554492999996,"samples":30464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":64003.880998,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64430.55061299999,"text":"On some routes, the larger companies use their own aircraft, but on other routes and with smaller companies, difficulties occurred."},{"kind":"audio","t":64489.144763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":64490.681212999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64492.308465999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64493.882408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64495.556011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64497.196915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64497.670653999994,"samples":15192,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":71370.73294900001,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":71708.168499,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means that they decay even with little or no stimulus."},{"kind":"audio","t":71762.917801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71764.44625200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":71766.070775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":71767.71194800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71769.413012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":71769.53411400001,"samples":9560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80037.65877200001,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende."},{"kind":"text","t":80293.144683,"text":"In the same month, another passenger plane overshot the runway."},{"kind":"audio","t":80345.869254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":80347.358414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":80349.014037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80349.755472,"samples":19896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":88769.83268600001,"text":"einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen, wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89089.493348,"text":"a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall, killing 17 people."},{"kind":"audio","t":89142.953244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89144.485985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89146.085227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89147.815302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":89147.92184400001,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":102880.83847500001,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103264.71478000001,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming options, and most offer shade provided by pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":103322.72640700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103324.413451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103325.925051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103327.556584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103329.25741800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103330.524084,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":114005.567673,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":114554.799505,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 motor racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":114620.065038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114625.351815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114631.169552,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114635.94848800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114641.258655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114646.464609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114651.70207500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114655.995001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":114656.92879,"samples":13256,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121556.70683200001,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":121882.558109,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses were not of such great importance."},{"kind":"audio","t":121936.885513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121938.49635500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":121940.103707,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121941.829482,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":121941.947954,"samples":4528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":130793.30257900001,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131103.097423,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. The largest is King George Island with the settlement Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":131158.751223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131160.845195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131162.56922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131164.257194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131164.384876,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":131209.360351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131210.78893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":131212.40555300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131214.280231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":131214.432704,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137563.49886300002,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":137849.204732,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic or basic the chemical is."},{"kind":"audio","t":137892.187497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":137893.593466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137895.545175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137897.153277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":137897.28431000002,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":142718.77071100002,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen."},{"kind":"text","t":143021.82597900002,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to become fully operational in September 2017."},{"kind":"audio","t":143076.456849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143077.943988,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143079.52614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":143081.208294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":143081.581852,"samples":15328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147837.40121100002,"text":"Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":148106.363763,"text":"It is expected that the Brazilian customs points will be completed by then."},{"kind":"audio","t":148160.793248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148162.252098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":148163.883771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148165.209897,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":158091.40926800002,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":158486.42987700002,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer."},{"kind":"audio","t":158561.929656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158563.44233700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158564.962887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158566.623731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158568.26565400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158569.289974,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":163920.724049,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164208.772245,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the Governor-General's office building."},{"kind":"audio","t":164264.338074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164265.740682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164267.406245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164267.972877,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":173036.526483,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173470.246321,"text":"The Moroccan Sultan rebuilt the city as Anfa, and it was called Casablanca by Spanish merchants who established trading posts there."},{"kind":"audio","t":173532.03927500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173533.567315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173535.198878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173536.845911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":173538.47645400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":173540.082277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":173541.488545,"samples":30792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":180655.914866,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt."},{"kind":"text","t":180978.281523,"text":"He was welcomed by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":181021.132075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181022.721027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":181024.3769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":181025.66657600002,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":187172.818923,"text":"und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs, über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187554.024734,"text":"and spoke with Lee Hsien Loong, the Prime Minister of Singapore, about trade and terrorism matters."},{"kind":"audio","t":187612.65939400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187614.14151400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":187615.821528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":187617.43192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187619.05930300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":187619.288517,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":200670.262847,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":200927.31858,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required."},{"kind":"audio","t":200981.664473,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200983.131183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200984.748165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200985.657834,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":201217.716923,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":201422.566785,"text":"to assemble a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":201473.038831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":201474.581262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201476.513331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":201476.680434,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207324.713842,"text":"Für die Archipelä und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207622.637777,"text":"You don't necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":207675.290646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207676.835497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207678.48009,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207678.772876,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217802.330699,"code":1005}]}